The  following  example  is  the complete sequence of commands to
bring a PPPoE connection up: # Need ethernet interface UP (or  it
won’t send any packets) ifconfig ne0 up

#  Let  pppoe0  use ne0 as its ethernet interface pppoectl ‐e ne0
pppoe0

# Configure authentication pppoectl pppoe0 \
  myauthproto=pap \
  myauthname=XXXXX \
  myauthsecret=YYYYY \
  hisauthproto=none

# Configure the pppoe0 interface  itself.   These  addresses  are
magic,  #  meaning we don’t care about either address and let the
remote # ppp choose them.  ifconfig pppoe0 0.0.0.0  0.0.0.1  net‐
mask  0xffffffff up The utility is based on the utility which ap‐
